1
00:00:00,595 --> 00:00:02,845
(Sheldon:)I can't do this. I'm going to faint.

2
00:00:03,015 --> 00:00:04,895
All right, drink this. It'll relax you.

3
00:00:05,058 --> 00:00:08,728
(Sheldon:)-Alcohol? I don't drink alcohol.
-Fine, faint.

4
00:00:14,109 --> 00:00:16,859
(Sheldon:)I don't feel different.
This alcohol's defective.

5
00:00:17,029 --> 00:00:19,239
(Penny:)Here. See if this one works.

6
00:00:21,908 --> 00:00:26,538
(Leonard(still talking):)First of all,
the projects were totally different.

7
00:00:27,456 --> 00:00:30,126
(Leonard(still talking):)I was showing that classical music
nurtures lima beans...

8
00:00:30,292 --> 00:00:32,922
(Leonard(still talking):)...and makes them grow.
But my mother didn't hear me.

9
00:00:33,086 --> 00:00:36,216
If you look at the relationship
between nurturing and growth...

10
00:00:36,381 --> 00:00:40,471
(Leonard(still talking):)...I'd like to point out that my brother
is 8 inches taller than me.

11
00:00:40,635 --> 00:00:43,925
SHELDON:
I'm ready!

12
00:00:44,973 --> 00:00:45,973
(Sheldon:)Right.

13
00:00:46,183 --> 00:00:48,223
(Leonard:)Ladies and gentlemen,
our guest of honor...

14
00:00:48,393 --> 00:00:49,813
(Leonard:)...Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

15
00:00:49,978 --> 00:00:51,978
[APPLAUSE]

16
00:00:53,106 --> 00:00:55,566
Thanks, shorty. I'll take it from here.

17
00:00:56,276 --> 00:00:58,816
(Sheldon:)All right,
you people ready to have some fun?

18
00:00:58,987 --> 00:01:01,487
You have an understanding
of differential calculus...

